  "methodology_note": "OWASP Dependency-Check (org.owasp:dependency-check-maven:check) was launched against the project but this environment has no NVD_API_KEY and no warm NVD DB volume; a cold first-time sync of the 345,727-record NVD CVE database progressed at ~10k records/70s (~12% in 4.5 min), which is infeasible to complete within this session. CVE-to-coordinate mappings therefore reuse the well-documented CVEs this deliberately-vulnerable demo repo's pom.xml comments identify per dependency, and every CVSS base score/severity was independently confirmed against the live NVD REST API (cvssv3.1), tagged cvss_source: nvd. dependency:tree, versions:display-dependency-updates and the license aggregate report ran to completion normally. The pom.xml also declares a deliberately-typosquatted, unresolvable coordinate (com.fastxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind) which blocks Maven dependency resolution outright; it was excluded from a scratch working copy (original pom.xml untouched) so the remaining 8 direct / 23 total dependencies could be resolved and scanned, and is reported separately as a CRITICAL supply-chain alert."
